{"date":"2014-10-06","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/03/44/91986_7nhBB.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/03/44/91986_7nhBB.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/03/44/91986_7nhBB.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/03/44/91986_7nhBB.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/03/44/91986_7nhBB.jpg"},"summary":"　　这里是人、神、魔等种族共同生活的神秘世界，密斯塔尔希亚。过去，黑银之翼的巴哈姆特曾几乎令这个世界毁灭，但人，神，魔三族共同战斗，作出了巨大的牺牲后，终于把它的力量封印了起来。接着，神与魔两方分别保存着封印钥匙的一半。二千年以后，世界始终和平安宁。　不知从什么时候起，人类将巴哈姆特当作了独一无二的尊贵存在，畏惧并崇拜它。某一天，一位少女夺走了保护严密的神族的钥匙。世界的均衡渐渐被打破。当巴哈姆特再次发出吼声之时，世界再次落入绝望的深渊。世界啊，毁灭吧！某个声音如此恳求着。 ","name":"神撃のバハムート GENESIS","name_cn":"巴哈姆特之怒 GENESIS","tags":[{"name":"游戏改","count":758,"total_count":161578},{"name":"MAPPA","count":637,"total_count":67193},{"name":"2014年10月","count":588,"total_count":29595},{"name":"TV","count":432,"total_count":1391756},{"name":"奇幻","count":426,"total_count":464442},{"name":"巴哈姆特之怒","count":422,"total_count":680},{"name":"2014","count":284,"total_count":70764},{"name":"战斗","count":269,"total_count":465687},{"name":"吉野裕行","count":124,"total_count":790},{"name":"佐藤敬一","count":93,"total_count":258},{"name":"さとうけいいち","count":47,"total_count":184},{"name":"cygames","count":45,"total_count":9136},{"name":"長谷川圭一","count":42,"total_count":393},{"name":"池頼広","count":33,"total_count":187},{"name":"日本","count":32,"total_count":290874},{"name":"冒险","count":30,"total_count":52990},{"name":"遊戲改","count":16,"total_count":169},{"name":"原创","count":15,"total_count":614678},{"name":"2014年","count":13,"total_count":4063},{"name":"恩田尚之","count":13,"total_count":379},{"name":"热血","count":12,"total_count":211235},{"name":"游戏改编","count":11,"total_count":2175},{"name":"日本动画","count":11,"total_count":34770},{"name":"魔幻","count":10,"total_count":2938},{"name":"清水理沙","count":8,"total_count":24},{"name":"沢城みゆき","count":8,"total_count":2425},{"name":"长谷川圭一","count":8,"total_count":55},{"name":"游改","count":8,"total_count":24